content.text:
Now controls fully visible. The plane is huge in landscape but nice. However the task panel overlaps the plane wing. The toast "Operación de llegada iniciada" sits at top 109 and overlaps scene; fine. Objective at bottom90 and controls at y? The objective pill is near bottom center, help chip at bottom, controls left and right. Good. The interact button isn't visible! In the screenshot, only joystick, run button, minimap, debug? Wait the interact button is missing at right bottom. The `.interact-btn` right:0 within .controls, width 94, height94, bottom2. But `.controls` is position absolute left23 right23 bottom18 height132; transform scale .82 from bottom left applied, so the right-aligned button gets moved left dramatically? Because transform origin bottom left scales the container, so right edge at (W-23-23)*.82+23? The controls width = 844-46=798 scaled .82=654, so right edge at x=23+654=677, leaving 167px empty at right. Indeed interact button missing from right side? At x677, should be visible around x600. In screenshot bottom right after minimap ends x~? minimap right137? It shows minimap at x574-677, and maybe interact button should be around x600-677 at bottom. But screenshot shows minimap, no big green button. Wait maybe interact button is at bottom right but clipped by control container due to scaling? Actually `.controls` height 132, width 798; transform scale .82 origin bottom left: all content fits in 654x108. Interact at right 0 → x 704? Hmm right edge of container (798) scaled =654 relative to 23 → x677. The button 94*.82=77 wide → x600..677, bottom y? container bottom at y? bottom 6, height108 → top 276; button bottom 2*0.82=1.6 above container bottom, so y around 384 -? container bottom y=390-6=384, button bottom=382, top=305. In screenshot at x600..677, y305..382 there is minimap? The minimap is at right 139 desktop, width133 → x572..705, bottom25? In max-height 600 override minimap bottom8, so y314..396 (height82), partially offscreen? The minimap overlaps exactly where interact button should be! On desktop, interact button right0, minimap right139, so no overlap. But after scaling controls container from left, interact button shifts left to x600, while minimap remains at right 139 (no scaling) x572..705. They overlap. The screenshot shows minimap on top of interact button (or vice versa). Looking closely, beneath the minimap there's no green button. Actually z-order: .minimap appears after .controls in DOM? index: controls at line20, minimap line25, so minimap later, on top. Yes it covers the interact button, making the game unplayable in landscape! That's a serious bug. The transform scaling the controls container breaks the right-aligned interact button position. Also on desktop width >700, max-height600 transform applies. For phones in landscape 844x390, max-height600 applies and breaks. Need fix.

Options:
- Don't scale the whole `.controls` container; instead reduce sizes for short viewports. Or remove transform and just use smaller control sizes at max-height.
- Better: in @media(max-height:600px) set `.controls{transform:none;bottom:6px;height:112px;left:12px;right:12px}` and scale individual controls sizes? The desktop sizes (116 joystick, 94 interact, 133 minimap) fit 390 height? Yes controls 132 high; at 390, top 240. Fine, no need to scale. The stats end at 291 and may overlap controls at right (interact top ~? 390-18-94=278) and stats right 19 width126, x699-825; interact right 0 within controls right23 → x727..821 y278..372; stats ends 291 → overlap 13px at top of interact. But stats z-order before controls? stats earlier line17, controls line20, so controls on top. Minor overlap in top 13 px. Could set stats top 135 and height148 ends 283; still. But button starts 278. 5px overlap. Acceptable maybe. Or shift stats top 128? worse. Could shrink stats on short height: set `.stats{top:132px;}`. Hmm.

- Alternative don't scale; keep .controls bottom 6; objective bottom 90. The game scene at 390 height. Top bar height65 top14, task panel top72. Stats top143. Controls top240; stats ends 291 -> overlaps controls in bottom-right region. The interact button x? right23, width94 -> x727..821, y 390-6-132+? Actually `.controls` height132 bottom18→ container top240; interact bottom2 → y 294..388. Stats y143..291. Overlap y294? no! Wait calc: container top=390-18-132=240; interact bottom2 means interact bottom at container bottom-2 = 390-18-2=370; height94 → top=276. Stats top143 height ~148 =291. Overlap 276..291 (15px). Right of stats x? stats right19 width126 → x699..825. Interact x? controls right23, interact right0 → right at 844-23=821, width94 → x727..821. So overlap 15px tall in the corner. It will be stats panel bottom (FONDOS row) overlapped by top of interact circle. Could change stats bottom? Short height media: set `.stats{top:133px;padding:5px 8px}` maybe height 4*30+10=130 ends 263. Need reduce `.stats div{height:30px;grid-template-rows:13px 13px}`. Could apply in max-height 600. Then stats ends 143+130? top maybe 136 + 4*30+12=268, still below 276? 268<276, no overlap. Good.

Alternatively keep min-height 440 and set body scroll? no.

Best: replace `.controls{transform:scale(.82);...}` with smaller scale of individual controls or remove. We can use CSS to scale joystick and interact individually:
```
@media(max-height:600px){
 .controls{height:112px;bottom:6px}
 .stick-zone{width:112px;height:108px}
