Bug: inside loop, loadClock decrements for every `b` each frame! Because the `if` is inside the for loop and each b in cart state. Need move clock outside loop. Let's rewrite properly:
```
if (world.phase===5) {
 world.loadClock -= dt;
 if (world.loadClock<=0) {
   const b=inboundBags.find(item=>item.state==='cart');
   if (b) {b.state='loading'...}
   world.loadClock=.9;
 }
}
for (const b of inboundBags) { if (b.state==='loading') {...}}
```
Let's fix.

